  "description": "Jun-U and Eun-Seo. Best friends since childhood. Jun-U, an artist and Eun-Seo, an actor. One day, Eun-Seo presents an offer to Jun-U that he just can’t refuse, an opportunity to meet his celeb crush Park Eden! All Eun-Seo asks for in return is a partner to go over some lines with. Sure, sounds harmless enough. That is until Jun-U realizes these scenes are much steamier than he’d anticipated… And when feelings start to get involved…are these rehearsals becoming practice for something more?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
